# GameStop Dashboard Environment Variables
# Core dashboard data uses FREE public APIs - no API keys required.

# No API keys needed - the application uses:
# - Yahoo Finance chart data (free, no key required)
# - Google/Bing RSS feeds (free, no key required)
# - SEC EDGAR database (free, no key required)
# - FINRA public short-interest data (free, no key required)
# - GameStop Investor Relations public pages and feeds

# Anonymous feedback storage is optional and writes public submissions to
# GitHub Issues from the server only. Use a fine-grained GitHub token scoped
# to this repository with Issues: Read and write.
GITHUB_FEEDBACK_TOKEN=
GITHUB_FEEDBACK_REPO=NYTEMODEONLY/gmedash

# Note: Market, filing, news, and investor-relations data sources are publicly
# available and do not require authentication.
